    content:`
      <h4>New Learning Centre Opened in Kilifi County</h4>
      <p><strong>📅 March 2025 · Education</strong></p>
      <p>Thanks to the incredible generosity of our donors, WAKA Foundation has officially opened a new learning centre in Kilifi County that will serve 400+ children who previously had no access to formal schooling.</p>
      <h4>The Challenge</h4>
      <p>Kilifi County has long struggled with educational access, particularly in rural areas where schools are few and far between. Many children walk over 10 kilometers daily to reach the nearest school, and some simply don't attend at all.</p>
      <h4>Our Solution</h4>
      <p>The new learning centre features:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>6 Classrooms:</strong> Fully equipped with desks, chairs, and learning materials</li>
        <li><strong>Library:</strong> Over 2,000 books and educational resources</li>
        <li><strong>Computer Lab:</strong> 20 computers for digital literacy training</li>
        <li><strong>Feeding Program:</strong> Daily nutritious meals for all students</li>
        <li><strong>Teacher Housing:</strong> On-site accommodation for 8 teachers</li>
      </ul>
      <h4>Impact</h4>
      <p>In just the first month, enrollment has exceeded expectations with 420 children already registered. The community has embraced the centre, with parents volunteering to help with maintenance and security.</p>
      <p><em>"This centre is a dream come true for our children. They now have hope for a better future."</em> — Local Chief, Kilifi County</p>
    `
  },
